    {
      "subId": "1104401",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the returning Albedo",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110440141"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110440141": {
            "id": "110440141",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I'm back. Did you see anything interesting?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440143",
              "110440145"
            ]
          },
          "110440143": {
            "id": "110440143",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Not to worry, they're all for alchemical purposes, you'd be hard pressed to find an everyday use for them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440146"
            ]
          },
          "110440146": {
            "id": "110440146",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Well, on with the research.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440101"
            ]
          },
          "110440101": {
            "id": "110440101",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "There may be significant differences between different worlds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440102"
            ]
          },
          "110440102": {
            "id": "110440102",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Take Teyvat, for example. Here, those with Visions can manipulate the elements.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440103"
            ]
          },
          "110440103": {
            "id": "110440103",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "But worlds may well exist where only one person is able to do so, or even everyone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440104"
            ]
          },
          "110440104": {
            "id": "110440104",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "#So, leaving elements to one side... Do you possess any... unique abilities, {NICKNAME}? Ones that don't exist in this world?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440105"
            ]
          },
          "110440105": {
            "id": "110440105",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I think answering this question calls for the same methodology as last time. In other words, time for the next experiment."
          },
          "110440145": {
            "id": "110440145",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Hmm, agreed. I'd love to find a moment to put them all in order. Still, experiments come first..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1104415",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "110440500"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "110440500": {
            "id": "110440500",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Mm! An average outcome experimentally, but you've really brought out the flavor. You seem well-versed in the science of gastronomy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440502"
            ]
          },
          "110440502": {
            "id": "110440502",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "As far as the proliferation hypothesis is concerned, we've come up short. Seems like food presents the same headaches in your world as it does ours.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440503"
            ]
          },
          "110440503": {
            "id": "110440503",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Unless... Could it be that the natural laws of this world are limiting your unique abilities?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440504"
            ]
          },
          "110440504": {
            "id": "110440504",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We just didn't know how to channel elemental power into the food. It's a little more complicated than adding herbs and spices, y'know!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440505"
            ]
          },
          "110440505": {
            "id": "110440505",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Not to worry, at least we put some food to good use, no need to feel disheartened.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440506"
            ]
          },
          "110440506": {
            "id": "110440506",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "And here's your portion, enjoy! I can box it up if you like.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440507"
            ]
          },
          "110440507": {
            "id": "110440507",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Woohoo, thanks! Glad you were paying attention.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440510"
            ]
          },
          "110440510": {
            "id": "110440510",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I can tell that you're good friends. Paimon was keeping an eye on you and your safety during the whole experiment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440511"
            ]
          },
          "110440511": {
            "id": "110440511",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Not that Paimon would have been able to do much if things had gone wrong, but anyway...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440512"
            ]
          },
          "110440512": {
            "id": "110440512",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! You were being nice a second ago!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440513"
            ]
          },
          "110440513": {
            "id": "110440513",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But you do have tasty recipes, so Paimon forgives you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440514"
            ]
          },
          "110440514": {
            "id": "110440514",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And you're right, we are good friends. You have good friends too, right? Good students?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440515"
            ]
          },
          "110440515": {
            "id": "110440515",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "...Uh, yes! I'm fortunate too, I suppose. Anyway, moving on to the next experiment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440516"
            ]
          },
          "110440516": {
            "id": "110440516",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "There are all manner of alchemical items here, keeping them in their proper place is a challenge at the best of times. A while ago, I had the misfortune of misplacing a batch.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440517"
            ]
          },
          "110440517": {
            "id": "110440517",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I managed to retrieve the majority, but two vials have been evading me: Anemo Crystalfly elemental extract and Electro Hypostasis powder.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440518"
            ]
          },
          "110440518": {
            "id": "110440518",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's barely finished eating and you want us to go gathering again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440519"
            ]
          },
          "110440519": {
            "id": "110440519",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "Don't worry if you can't locate them. I was planning to replace them anyway, though finding them would save me the hassle.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440520"
            ]
          },
          "110440520": {
            "id": "110440520",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "If you had, say, a \"superpower,\" like night vision, or vibratory sensing, lost property would be a thing of the past.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440521"
            ]
          },
          "110440521": {
            "id": "110440521",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Albedo",
            "text": "I must have dropped them somewhere in the area where you were looking just now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440522"
            ]
          },
          "110440522": {
            "id": "110440522",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... guess we'd better take a look?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440523"
            ]
          },
          "110440523": {
            "id": "110440523",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There should be some elemental traces on the lost items.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "110440524"
            ]
          },
          "110440524": {
            "id": "110440524",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh yeah! You could use Elemental Sight!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1104416",
